<com:TContent ID="body">

<h1>TDataGrid Sample 7</h1>
<h2>Using an Item Renderer in a Template Column</h2>

<p>The third column is a <tt>TTemplateColumn</tt> whose <tt>ItemRenderer</tt> names
<tt>StockCell</tt>, a class that extends <tt>TDataGridItemRenderer</tt> and carries its own
template.</p>

<com:TDataGrid
	ID="DataGrid"
	AutoGenerateColumns="false"
	CellPadding="2"
	HeaderStyle.BackColor="black"
	HeaderStyle.ForeColor="white"
	ItemStyle.BackColor="#BFCFFF"
	AlternatingItemStyle.BackColor="#E6ECFF">

	<com:TBoundColumn HeaderText="ID" DataField="id" />
	<com:TBoundColumn HeaderText="Name" DataField="name" />
	<com:TTemplateColumn
		HeaderText="Stock"
		ItemRenderer="Application.pages.Controls.Samples.TDataGrid.StockCell" />

</com:TDataGrid>

</com:TContent>
